{"title":"Mathkiddie","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Mathkiddie is mathkiddie. Mathkiddie is the MATH OF THE KIDDIES!! HOORAY!!! MATH KID DIE!!!!!!!!!!!!\n</p><p>\"HELLO, WELCOME. HOORAY! HOORAY!! I am the MATH of the KIDDIES. HELLO! HELLO! HOORAY!! WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF MATH!!!\" -Mathkiddie, 2021\n</p><p>Mathkiddie is an omnipotent person, and you may recieve his all-knowing by friending him.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.002 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.002 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23109:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018095031 and revision id 285382. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}